{"id":"652635","name":"凉拌木耳花菜","author":"冬季心情","authorId":"8473848","desc":"","cover":"images/652635/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"木耳","amount":"6朵"},{"name":"花菜","amount":"190g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"25g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"3瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备原料。","img":"images/652635/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黑木耳泡发撕成小块，花菜洗净切块，胡萝卜切丝，蒜切碎。","img":"images/652635/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中烧开水，黑木耳煮熟捞出备用。","img":"images/652635/step_3.jpeg"},{"step":4,"desc":"花菜煮熟捞出备用。","img":"images/652635/step_4.jpeg"},{"step":5,"desc":"花菜，胡萝卜，黑木耳倒入盆中。","img":"images/652635/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜放入小碗中，加入生抽。","img":"images/652635/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入米醋。","img":"images/652635/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入盐。","img":"images/652635/step_8.jpeg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入白糖。","img":"images/652635/step_9.jpeg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加辣椒红油，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/652635/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"调料放入盆中，搅拌均匀装盘即可。","img":"images/652635/step_11.jpeg"},{"step":12,"desc":"酸辣美味的凉拌菜上桌啦。","img":"images/652635/step_12.jpeg"}],"tips":"黑木耳提前泡发，撕成小块，煮熟。花菜煮熟。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}